  "rulesAccepted": {
    "unlockBay": "Only unlocked bays exclude ordinary wander/spawn. Successful paid unlock moves ordinary kids inside the bay plus its 16-unit clearance to nearest clear spots, clear of recipe partners, without fusion, using refused-planting placement. All displacement and payment are atomic. Fail only for price, save state or noRoom anywhere; no charge or movement on failure.",
    "progress": "One fractional bite accumulator per field. Removing kids preserves it. Switching food resets it only after explicit review.",
    "foodChange": "Keep compatible workers; return haters atomically by Garden. Block if any returning kid cannot fit. Never consume stock.",
    "return": "Atomic one/all; preserve identity/name/look and original happiness expiry.",
    "pantry": "Shared integer bites per food, no manual harvest; zero stock still listed. No cap in the MVP for now; simulator hoarding review may require a new visible cap design.",
    "feeding": "Atomic decrement one bite + replace happiness on captured instance. No Materials charge. Farming kids may be fed; happiness keeps counting down and the Materials boost applies only on return.",
    "capacity": "Farmers are off the map count and capacity, do not wander or fuse, earn no Materials, and need room on the map to return.",
    "workerLimit": "At most four workers per field."
